.TH PSMatrixFree 3 2023-12-07 "PsyC 0.9.3" "PsyC Library Functions Manual"

.SH NAME
PSMatrixFree

.SH LIBRARY
PsyC (-lpsyc)

.SH SYNOPSIS

.B
#include <psyc/maths.h>

.I
void  
.br
\fBPSMatrixFree\fR(\fIPSMatrix matrix\fR)
.SH DESCRIPTION
Free \fImatrix\fR by also deleting all its private data (including the cached transposed versiob of \fImatrix\fR if any).
.br
If \fImatrix\fR is \fINULL\fR, the function will directly return.
.br

.br
\fBWARN\fR:  this function should not be directly called on \fImatrix\fR if it's  the cached transposed version of another matrix (see \fIPSMatrixTranspose\fR): in this case the function \fIPSMatrixResetTransposed\fR should be used instead.
.br

.SH SEE ALSO
PSMatrixResetTransposed(3), PSMatrixTranspose(3)
